{quote}
Why fail if some other config is invalid?
{quote}

But what about cross-field validations? For example, if the group had an invalid consumer.heartbeat.interval.ms=60000 value caused by restarting the controller with a new range limit, what happens if users configure consumer.session.timeout.ms=50000? Should we compare the session timeout with the invalid heartbeat? If we require all configs to be valid, users must fix the invalid heartbeat first, and then the session timeout could be checked against a valid heartbeat

